{"seq":95,"slug":"game-ai-behavior-trees","title":"游戏 AI 决策系统","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees","rating":{"composite":4.24,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":4,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"游戏-ai-决策系统-行为树权威指南\">游戏 AI 决策系统：行为树权威指南</h1><blockquote>\n<p>行为树（Behavior Tree，BT）是现代游戏 AI 的主流决策框架，从《光环 3》的 ODST 士兵到《最后生还者》的感染者，从 Unreal Engine 内置 AI 到 Unity 的开源 BT 库，行为树已成为游戏 AI 程序员必须掌握的核心技能。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-解决什么问题\">本 Hub 解决什么问题</h2><p>中级游戏 AI 程序员面临的核心困境：状态机（FSM）写出来臃肿难维护，GOAP 规划太慢，Utility AI 评分系统难调试——行为树在三者之间提供了一个可扩展、可组合、可视化的中间地带。本 Hub 从底层 tick 机制到生产级工程实践，系统化讲解行为树的设计与实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内容结构\">内容结构</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>关键问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第 1 章：决策系统基础</td>\n<td>范式对比与 BT 核心机制</td>\n<td>为什么选 BT？tick 如何工作？</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 2 章：节点类型详解</td>\n<td>组合节点 + 装饰节点 + 叶节点</td>\n<td>每种节点的语义与实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 3 章：进阶技术</td>\n<td>并行 BT、BT+GOAP 混合、ML 辅助</td>\n<td>复杂 AI 行为的工程路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第 4 章：工程实践</td>\n<td>可视化编辑器、调试、测试</td>\n<td>如何让 BT 可维护、可迭代</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"与兄弟-hub-的边界\">与兄弟 Hub 的边界</h2><ul>\n<li><strong><code>89_game-state-machines</code>（有限状态机）</strong>：FSM 是 BT 的前辈，适合状态少、转换明确的 AI；BT 适合状态多、行为可组合复用的 AI。两者不是竞争关系，BT 的叶节点内部可以包含小 FSM。</li>\n<li><strong><code>03_game-ai</code>（游戏 AI 总论）</strong>：宏观框架，覆盖寻路（A*）、感知系统、导航网格；本 Hub 聚焦决策层，与感知/运动层正交，默认读者已了解 NavMesh 和基础 AI 架构。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"适合读者\">适合读者</h2><ul>\n<li>有 FSM 经验、想升级到 BT 的游戏 AI 程序员</li>\n<li>使用 Unreal Engine 5 BT Editor 或 Unity BT 框架但想理解底层原理的开发者</li>\n<li>需要实现自定义 BT 引擎的技术负责人</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><code>89_game-state-machines</code>：FSM 基础，理解 BT 的演化背景</li>\n<li><code>03_game-ai</code>：感知系统与导航，BT 的感知输入层</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"决策系统基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ai-paradigm-comparison","title":"游戏 AI 范式对比与选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/foundations/ai-paradigm-comparison"},{"seq":2,"slug":"behavior-tree-anatomy","title":"行为树解剖：tick 机制与数据流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/foundations/behavior-tree-anatomy"},{"seq":3,"slug":"blackboard-architecture","title":"Blackboard 通信架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/foundations/blackboard-architecture"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"node-types","title":"节点类型详解","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/node-types","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"composite-nodes","title":"组合节点：Sequence、Selector 与 Parallel","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/node-types/composite-nodes"},{"seq":2,"slug":"decorator-nodes","title":"装饰节点：修改行为语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/node-types/decorator-nodes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"leaf-nodes","title":"叶节点：Action、Condition 与 Service","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/node-types/leaf-nodes"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"advanced","title":"进阶技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/advanced","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"parallel-reactive-bt","title":"并行与响应式行为树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/advanced/parallel-reactive-bt"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bt-goap-hybrid","title":"行为树与 GOAP 混合架构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/advanced/bt-goap-hybrid"},{"seq":3,"slug":"ml-assisted-bt","title":"机器学习辅助行为树","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/advanced/ml-assisted-bt"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"engineering","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/engineering","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"visual-bt-editor","title":"可视化行为树编辑器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/engineering/visual-bt-editor"},{"seq":2,"slug":"debugging-profiling","title":"调试与性能分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/engineering/debugging-profiling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"testing-validation","title":"测试与验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-ai-behavior-trees/engineering/testing-validation"}]}]}